# Encoding by total instead of membership: a group with a member whose numeric
# is 0 is published as if it had no members.
MODULE: QuiescentExactZeroSumAbsent
TARGET: QuiescentExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a batch publishes a live Sum group whose total is zero as absent
PERTURBS: FlushBatch

--- FIND
               /\ pub' = [g \in Groups |-> IF g \in aff THEN Enc(s1[g]) ELSE pub[g]]
--- REPLACE
               /\ pub' = [g \in Groups |-> IF g \in aff
                     THEN IF s1[g].sum = 0 THEN Absent ELSE Enc(s1[g]) ELSE pub[g]]
--- END
